; The ONE variable: which rect a Control anchors against when its DIRECT parent
; is a CanvasItem that is not a Control. `get_parent_anchorable_rect` reads
; `data.parent_canvas_item` (control.cpp:685-711) — the direct parent, from
; `get_parent_item()` — and `CanvasItem::get_anchorable_rect` is
; `Rect2(0, 0, 0, 0)` (canvas_item.h:414), which Control alone overrides. The
; enclosing Panel is deliberately NOT full-rect, so anchoring against IT rather
; than against the zero rect lands the box somewhere else entirely.

